# Lumina Dental — Environment Variables

All branding/content is configured in `src/config/site.tsx`.
Environment variables are only needed for **form email delivery** (optional).

## Lead / form email (optional)

The contact and booking forms POST to `/api/contact` and `/api/booking`.
Out of the box they work in "log mode" — submissions are logged on the
server. To send real emails via Resend (https://resend.com), set:

RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_api_key_here
LEAD_TO_EMAIL=you@yourclinic.com
LEAD_FROM_EMAIL=notifications@yourdomain.com

If `RESEND_API_KEY` or `LEAD_TO_EMAIL` are missing, the app falls back to
logging the submission instead of failing. See `FORM-INTEGRATION.md`.

## Site URL (used by metadata / sitemap)

NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://www.your-domain.com

(Optional. If unset, the value in `src/config/site.tsx` → `seo.metadataBase`
is used.)
